# Credential-derived material (P24B-08).
# Directory-level rules, not an enumeration of filenames: anything the app or a
# library may drop into these directories is secret by definition (OAuth client
# secrets, refresh tokens, VAPID private keys, key files, database dumps).
# A new file name cannot leak by simply not being listed.
backend/credentials/
backend/vapid/
backend/cache/
# Local secret files, anchored so the tracked templates stay trackable.
backend/.secret_key
backend/.ingest_key
backend/.secret_key.*
backend/.ingest_key.*

# backups
backups/
